e-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T09:00:17-07:00","id":1408728,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408722#post1408722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Agreed. I think Helena should be effectively invincible to PCs, similar to Mithras.<br /> <br /> You could defeat her with plot fiat but not actual guns and torches.</div> </div> </div> </div>torches is fine, incendiary ammo though...less elegant","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T16:02:42-07:00","id":1408803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408641#post1408641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What I love about Ravnos is his falling to wassail.<br /> <br /> Like, the Antediluvian isn't killed by nukes or the sun. He's killed by degenerating into a wild, soulless, inhuman animal without any intelligence.<br /> <br /> In other words, The Antediluvian was beaten by losing his Humanity.</div> </div> </div> </div>Was he really in wassail? I know he was frenzied like mad but wasn't he using high levels of Chimerstry and animalism to conjured new creatures when he was fighting off the garou? Chimerstry is a high mental discipline and falling to wassail prevents a vampire from using high level mental disciplines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23908-kael03","name":"Kael03","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"230"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T16:27:40-07:00","id":1408809,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kael03</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408803#post1408803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Was he really in wassail? I know he was frenzied like mad but wasn't he using high levels of Chimerstry and animalism to conjured new creatures when he was fighting off the garou? Chimerstry is a high mental discipline and falling to wassail prevents a vampire from using high level mental disciplines.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe as an Antediluvian he can still use high level mental Disciplines even after he falls to Wassail?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T16:54:51-07:00","id":1408813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kael03</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408803#post1408803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Was he really in wassail? I know he was frenzied like mad but wasn't he using high levels of Chimerstry and animalism to conjured new creatures when he was fighting off the garou? Chimerstry is a high mental discipline and falling to wassail prevents a vampire from using high level mental disciplines.</div> </div> </div> </div>My take is that he was in wassail and that's why he behaved the way he did--a mindless, ravening beast not having any deep plans and only a burning lust to kill.<br /> <br /> And in the case of high mental disciplines, he didn't show much given that he was just slaughtering thousands of people.<br /> <br /> Maybe his creations were just incarnate nightmares.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T21:14:09-07:00","id":1408844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408572#post1408572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> yeah, a lot less,<br /> <br /> though I'm not sure about the power gap between PC and Methuselah,<br /> I believe, in 1st ed, the PCs could confront methuselah face to face (but don't quote me on that)<br /> <br /> think it's revised that made them into instant death encounters,<br /> the gap between the rank and file sabbat and a methuselah (or any other god like Tezcatlipoca) was huge,<br /> you had to be very...creative to get them (cut off their herds, lure lupines, start a war, break the masquerade...canonically though, alot of it was handled through blood magic which usually was not accessible to sabbat PCs)<br /> <br /> in V5, seems like even mortals can take down methuselahs</div> </div> </div> </div>1e Helena had Dominate 8, so the Coeteries new name was 'pet'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T21:22:14-07:00","id":1408848,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408844#post1408844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1e Helena had Dominate 8, so the Coeteries new name was 'pet'.</div> </div> </div> </div>Slight correction: Helena wasn't at full strength so the PCs had a short window of opportunity before she was a god versus an incredibly potent Elder.<br /> <br /> She got to full power with Brett Stryker's help (providing her dozens of 8th generation Toreador women and men to feed on in her sex/blood dungeon) by 2nd Edition and any hope of the PC's stopping her was gone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T21:32:35-07:00","id":1408853,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408848#post1408848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Slight correction: Helena wasn't at full strength so the PCs had a short window of opportunity before she was a god versus an incredibly potent Elder.<br /> <br /> She got to full power with Brett Stryker's help (providing her dozens of 8th generation Toreador women and men to feed on in her sex/blood dungeon) by 2nd Edition and any hope of the PC's stopping her was gone.</div> </div> </div> </div>She's more terrifying in 2e, but still rocks that amount of Dominate in 1e, but yes her other Disciplines are lower than they will be, when she is at full power","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T21:49:21-07:00","id":1408855,"title":"","content":"Even in V5 Helena is going to have a base of at least 13 dice for any rolls involving Dominate or Presence\u201417 if the storyteller has her Blood Surge\u2014so I don't foresee her losing such tests often against PC level opposition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T00:12:59-07:00","id":1408861,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408855#post1408855\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even in V5 Helena is going to have a base of at least 13 dice for any rolls involving Dominate or Presence\u201417 if the storyteller has her Blood Surge\u2014so I don't foresee her losing such tests often against PC level opposition.</div> </div> </div> </div>But she can lose and it's not terribly unlikely. 13 is not so much bigger than 8. a coterie of neonates have a good shot at taking her down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T00:42:05-07:00","id":1408865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408861#post1408861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But she can lose and it's not terribly unlikely. 13 is not so much bigger than 8. a coterie of neonates have a good shot at taking her down.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, my one major issue with V5 is the fact that much of the lore is built on godlike ancients.<br /> <br /> You should leave Helena and Mithras statless if you're going to do this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T01:08:27-07:00","id":1408873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408855#post1408855\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even in V5 Helena is going to have a base of at least 13 dice for any rolls involving Dominate or Presence\u201417 if the storyteller has her Blood Surge\u2014so I don't foresee her losing such tests often against PC level opposition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Her loosing to. Coeterie isn't the heart of the issue, her not being able to use presence and dominate against entire cities or family lines is, she is supposed to be a demigod, a regional apocalypse waiting to happen, she isn't any more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T02:00:59-07:00","id":1408875,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408873#post1408873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Her loosing to. Coeterie isn't the heart of the issue, her not being able to use presence and dominate against entire cities or family lines is, she is supposed to be a demigod, a regional apocalypse waiting to happen, she isn't any more.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's why I support revised Elder rules or The Withering for non-Beckoned or escaped elders (like Helena).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T02:24:34-07:00","id":1408877,"title":"","content":"The thing with Meths isn't that they're supposed to show up and duke it out with you and totally wreck your shit. They're supposed to wreck you whilst doing their absolute best not to expose themselves and wreck your shit. <br /> <br /> They don't dominate you to kill yourself (namely because that's a stupid idea and only serves as showing off) but they get elders to send neonates after you. They in turn Dominate your friends and family... all the while the Meth stays at a safe distance. The exception to this is the Niktuku, who stay completely hidden but still come to kill you personally. You're supposed to fight a Methuselah with your brains. You hunt them down through the clues they leave or you draw them out... <br /> The thing with V5 is that you can't really support these hidden methuselah. They can't really work through elders because they're only slightly stronger than elders and would likely be attacked by such elders. The Dominate and Auspex powers that allowed for 4d methuselah chess to be played are gone, and the physicals of the game have changed to the point that, though Celerity and Fortitude 5 might be really good for one-on-one fights, Potence is pretty useless if you can't land a hit, and numerous enemies will destroy you. Oh and the Methuselah's have got all sorts of logistical problems like Vitae-only feeding and extra hunger dice...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T04:09:09-07:00","id":1408881,"title":"","content":"the sabbat used was defined by their enemies,<br /> the evil zealous extremism we know them for wasn't a choice but a necessity, a direct result of the unsurmountable adversity they faced,<br /> one that pushed them further and futher into the dark side after each challenge<br /> <br /> the methuselah were a huge part of this adversity, along with lupines and whatever else<br /> <br /> alot of the dilemmas you face as a sabbat and the compromises that follow rely on elders and methuselahs being a real threat,<br /> <br /> - you could say you don't want the vinculum, that being tied to so many others is too much, but no vinculum means you're open to being blood bound and alone against your enemies<br /> <br /> - you can say that you don't want to take on a path of enlightenment, but humanity is too restrictive when faced with your enemies<br /> <br /> - you can say that you hate diablerie, that you wouldn't lower yourself to blood magic or infernalism, but what choice do you have when faced with all powerful methuselahs?<br /> <br /> <br /> now all those dilemmas are gone, the Anarchs or the SI are more than enough to challenge the ancients,<br /> the sabbat is an unnecessary and unjustified compromise,<br /> edgelords for the sake of being edgelords...if that's the angle the devs are going for, then the sabbat are the true antagonists, not the ancients","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T05:06:39-07:00","id":1408887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408865#post1408865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, my one major issue with V5 is the fact that much of the lore is built on godlike ancients.<br /> <br /> You should leave Helena and Mithras statless if you're going to do this.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think a coterie of neonates should have a chance at stopping Helena or Mithras, but it should be the focus of an entire chronicle. Actually destroying them should be impossible unless the PCs have achieved the power level of elders themselves, and even then it would take extraordinary heroism and a lot of luck (kind of like beating an end boss in a video game). I also don\u2019t think the PCs should expect to take out a Methuselah at the climax of every chronicle or it loses its specialness really fast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T06:01:05-07:00","id":1408899,"title":"","content":"When it comes to Methuselah, I'd rather just go by the rules. I really don't like railroading; So if a player comes up with a good way to kill such characters, one the Methuselah's haven't planned around or can't forsee, and I can't get mad at them for being too meta, I'd totally let them take out such a character if the dice go their way. Normally I can play meths well enough (IE the players never knew they were there) that this doesn't come up. But I suppose if I was going by V5 rules and my players turned on my secret methuselah they might never find out the truth from his corpse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 08-18-2020, 09:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T07:18:46-07:00","id":1408921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408848#post1408848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Slight correction: Helena wasn't at full strength so the PCs had a short window of opportunity before she was a god versus an incredibly potent Elder.<br /> <br /> She got to full power with Brett Stryker's help (providing her dozens of 8th generation Toreador women and men to feed on in her sex/blood dungeon) by 2nd Edition and any hope of the PC's stopping her was gone.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow that\u2019s incredibly hot, also what those Dominate 8 do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T07:24:57-07:00","id":1408923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408921#post1408921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wow that\u2019s incredibly hot, also what those Dominate 8 do?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Dominate_(VTM)\" target=\"_blank\">https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Dominate_(VTM)</a><br /> <br /> this should give you an idea","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T14:38:22-07:00","id":1409013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408875#post1408875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's why I support revised Elder rules or The Withering for non-Beckoned or escaped elders (like Helena).</div> </div> </div> </div>But that still leaves them as not all that scary, tough sure, but you may as well give them a CR at this point, rather than being cthonic blood gods to get are slightly tougher elders","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T15:04:57-07:00","id":1409018,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409013#post1409013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But that still leaves them as not all that scary, tough sure, but you may as well give them a CR at this point, rather than being cthonic blood gods to get are slightly tougher elders</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, that would be why it's an interesting setting event. For the first time in ever, they're potentially vulnerable and this could result in massive upheavels in the Kindred world and a weakening of their power.<br /> <br /> I find it the MOST interesting time for the setting when its a time of the vampire status quo being disrupted.<br /> <br /> Because without a Withering there's no actual point to Methuselahs showing up:<br /> <br /> &quot;You obey&quot; or &quot;you die.&quot;<br /> <br /> There's no reason to roleplay them even.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T15:28:55-07:00","id":1409025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409018#post1409018\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, that would be why it's an interesting setting event. For the first time in ever, they're potentially vulnerable and this could result in massive upheavels in the Kindred world and a weakening of their power.<br /> <br /> I find it the MOST interesting time for the setting when its a time of the vampire status quo being disrupted.<br /> <br /> Because without a Withering there's no actual point to Methuselahs showing up:<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;You obey&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;you die.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> There's no reason to roleplay them even.</div> </div> </div> </div>I kinda know what the Withering is, but could you explain it in a little more detail?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T15:33:14-07:00","id":1409028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409025#post1409025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I kinda know what the Withering is, but could you explain it in a little more detail?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a thing from the Gehenna book that was the last book of the Old World of Darkness before V20 revived it. Basically, the Withering is when vampires start suffering a loss of Disciplines and Generation as Gehenna approaches. This obviously causes a lot of turmoil in Kindred society but a way is discovered that allows the Elders to forestall it by committing diablerie. This actually triggers what people believed the Antediluvians would be doing alone and that's the Elders devouring the young. This causes the Elders to massively drop their humanity and go insane, though, while the young realize, &quot;Fuck it. What do we have to lose.&quot; They then start murdering Elders and diablerizing them for THEIR power because its the only way to survive.<br /> <br /> Theo Bell, notably, kills Hardelstadt during all this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T19:05:51-07:00","id":1409050,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1408873#post1408873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Her loosing to. Coeterie isn't the heart of the issue, her not being able to use presence and dominate against entire cities or family lines is, she is supposed to be a demigod, a regional apocalypse waiting to happen, she isn't any more.</div> </div> </div> </div>Helena never had that kind of direct power. If you read the actual descriptions of her advanced powers in <i>Chicago by Night 2nd Edition</i>, the scope of her Dominate wasn't terribly wide. In fact I think the current power Mass Manipulation is more effective than her 8th dot power was back then. Her advanced Auspex feats can be done with powers available in the current set. And she &quot;only&quot; ever had Presence 5. Her big advantage was that three thousand years of experience let her know exactly how to best use her pawns to influence the larger community and get what she wanted done, all while running circles around the oblivious lesser power players in the city.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T22:23:13-07:00","id":1409077,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409050#post1409050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Helena never had that kind of direct power. If you read the actual descriptions of her advanced powers in <i>Chicago by Night 2nd Edition</i>, the scope of her Dominate wasn't terribly wide. In fact I think the current power Mass Manipulation is more effective than her 8th dot power was back then. Her advanced Auspex feats can be done with powers available in the current set. And she &amp;quot;only&amp;quot; ever had Presence 5. Her big advantage was that three thousand years of experience let her know exactly how to best use her pawns to influence the larger community and get what she wanted done, all while running circles around the oblivious lesser power players in the city.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then use another named.Meth as the example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T22:27:16-07:00","id":1409078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409018#post1409018\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, that would be why it's an interesting setting event. For the first time in ever, they're potentially vulnerable and this could result in massive upheavels in the Kindred world and a weakening of their power.<br /> <br /> I find it the MOST interesting time for the setting when its a time of the vampire status quo being disrupted.<br /> <br /> Because without a Withering there's no actual point to Methuselahs showing up:<br /> <br /> &quot;You obey&quot; or &quot;you die.&quot;<br /> <br /> There's no reason to roleplay them even.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup. That's the horror, you can never win, everything to you do is pointless posturing when the real rulers of the world walk, V5 is making them boss monsters, completely removing that horror, now you xp grind, tool up and go kill the boss.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T23:20:17-07:00","id":1409080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409078#post1409078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yup. That's the horror, you can never win, everything to you do is pointless posturing when the real rulers of the world walk, V5 is making them boss monsters, completely removing that horror, now you xp grind, tool up and go kill the boss.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or you could, you know, roleplay what actual vulnerability does to these monsters and their personalities.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T00:14:39-07:00","id":1409086,"title":"","content":"but we can do that with any vampire. The arrogance of being invincible to most moddern gutter trash, plus the paranoia of having seen what's higher than them, is what makes elders and ancients interesting, and they drive the vulnerablities of neonates and ancillae well up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T00:19:46-07:00","id":1409087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409086#post1409086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">but we can do that with any vampire. The arrogance of being invincible to most moddern gutter trash, plus the paranoia of having seen what's higher than them, is what makes elders and ancients interesting, and they drive the vulnerablities of neonates and ancillae well up.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not to put too fine a point on it but the weakness of a Methuselah and the depths he will go to regain his full power forms the basis of a solid and interesting campaign with THE FALL OF LONDON.<br /> <br /> Mithras is a character the players are meant to revere, worship, and love before they see just what a pile of shit he is when he doesn't get his way.<br /> <br /> He also can't brainwash them into total obedience either.<br /> <br /> It makes a fascinating Chronicle and one I enjoyed playing as well as STing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T00:33:07-07:00","id":1409088,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409080#post1409080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Or you could, you know, roleplay what actual vulnerability does to these monsters and their personalities.</div> </div> </div> </div>Makes them way less interesting. They always had vulnerability, but to other beings of similar age and power (or enough Elders). Now they are just slightly more powerful Elders and fade into that background, the irony of getting 'Cults of the Blood Gods' when their is nothing in setting worthy of the title anymore is amusing at least, I suppose. What used to be continent wide puppet masters and threats now have to walk softly round Princes and Primogen of major cities, that Eldritch menace is missing now, Shaitan is about the same as Mithras who is about the same as Vitel or even Ur Shulgi, maybe each has slightly different tricks, but at heart they are bound to the same chains and eminently beatable, and they flat out cannot do what their stories claim they can, the rules no longer support the story, leaving both floundering","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T00:35:26-07:00","id":1409089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409087#post1409087\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not to put too fine a point on it but the weakness of a Methuselah and the depths he will go to regain his full power forms the basis of a solid and interesting campaign with THE FALL OF LONDON.<br /> <br /> Mithras is a character the players are meant to revere, worship, and love before they see just what a pile of shit he is when he doesn't get his way.<br /> <br /> He also can't brainwash them into total obedience either.<br /> <br /> It makes a fascinating Chronicle and one I enjoyed playing as well as STing.</div> </div> </div> </div>When was Mithras not a megalomaniacal asshole? He used to at least be able to back it up, now he's just a spoilt brat. Which is why Fall of London fell flat for me, he had been reduced to just another wannabe Prince or Baron who could be dethroned by a smart coeterie...yea, no, that's what Lady Anne is for, not.a Methuselah older than world faiths. That strays to close to the Punch Out Cthulhu tropes. It's also the problem I have with the Gehenna Crusade, it should be suicide, and if it isn't the setting looses way more than it could ever gain.<br /> <br /> To link this back to the original topic: the Sabbat for me was always about knowing all was lost, and deciding to embrace all that means, fully, stop pretending to be cursed humans, revel in being the doomed children of blood gods, take all the pleasure and enlightenment that revelation brings, and at the last go down swinging, screaming defiance at the end of all things, you cannot win, ultimately, but make it as costly as you can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 08-19-2020, 03:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T03:40:18-07:00","id":1409105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409089#post1409089\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> When was Mithras not a megalomaniacal asshole? He used to at least be able to back it up, now he's just a spoilt brat. Which is why Fall of London fell flat for me, he had been reduced to just another wannabe Prince or Baron who could be dethroned by a smart coeterie...yea, no, that's what Lady Anne is for, not.a Methuselah older than world faiths.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd argue he's much more interesting in that as a being barely more powerful than an Elder brings down the most powerful Camarilla City in the world and makes the Second Inquisition his tool.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T04:23:56-07:00","id":1409108,"title":"","content":"Helena and Menele where already defeatable in 1st and second ED as you where supposed to make them kill each other or make their tralls rebel against them.<br /> <br /> Then every character had personal issues that you could potentially exploit to make them defeat each other while you laugh in the background , using cunning to overcome the power gap.<br /> <br /> V5 meths instead are boring to the point that they don\u00b4t even serve as a boss becuase they are so weak that a bunch of goons with a rauffoss can kill them if they wish so and Helena for example only has three dices advantage over ballard a 8th Gen ancillae.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24037-leandro16","name":"Leandro16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24037_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T06:21:46-07:00","id":1409123,"title":"","content":"I've said it before and think it bears mentioning again. Ever since 1E, the overarching theme has been the young against the old. But realistically, the mechanics never supported the young being able to take out the old until V5. Helena's write-up in V5 shows there is already a possibility for ancient blood gods. Says she fought off the Beckoning but is reduced in power. Perhaps with Antediluvians waking, drawing lines, etc..., they draw power back into themselves, allowing only those working for them (Ur Shulgi) to keep their formidable might.<br /> <br /> Taking it back to the Sabbat, what if they went on Crusade, fully expecting to lose (but better to die on your feet and all that), then realized with this weakening, actually could achieve it? Not realizing, of course, that some ancients they devour will devour them from inside, and thus be able to walk among the masses of vampires with none the wiser? I think something like that could open up new possibilities with the Sabbat, making them distinct from the Camarilla and Anarchs.<br /> <br /> The Camarilla is the system, the Anarchs fight for equality, and the Sabbat returns as the monsters now hunting dark blood gods hidden among the Sects. Takes a thief to catch a thief?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","name":"PJ123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T07:30:32-07:00","id":1409131,"title":"","content":"If the young toppled the old as easily as they could in V5 then we'd have a very petty conflict. The old mechanics did enable you to fight the old... but it was a struggle, and vampire is all about that struggle. <br /> As for the Vampires getting weaker... Isn't it better that the Cainite state remains unchanging and eternal? Stuff like the Withering's cool for a Gehenna scenario, but flipping a switch and changing how vampires work is a bit much, no? I think the thing with V5 is that the power level changes are retcons not in-universe shifts. <br /> <br /> Also being unable to devour ancients... It's pretty old hat. Saulot,Lasombra and Tzmisce planned their 'diablerie' and their possession. That was cool. Having possession occur every time someone chows down on a 6th gen just kills the interest and appeal of diablerie. Why would anyone commit multiple diableries under the new system, given how punishing it is and how much it lacks rewards (There are plenty of rewards if you're a saint-diablerist but let's get real here) <br /> <br /> And the Anarchs fighting for 'equality' has never been 'equality', it's 'Make me more equal with them'. <br /> <br /> The one way to salvage the Sabbat from the V5 metaplot is to have the Gehenna war a scam; The elders of the Sabbat have betrayed their neonates as part of the all-round neonate progrom lead by elders of all sects who have realised they really need to cut down on kindred numbers to survive the next 50 years. Most of the Sabbat neonates sent over to fight in the middle east were killed in their shipping containers. But the ones who survived.... They'll be back with a vengence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T09:27:43-07:00","id":1409152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409105#post1409105\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'd argue he's much more interesting in that as a being barely more powerful than an Elder brings down the most powerful Camarilla City in the world and makes the Second Inquisition his tool.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>To me it made it totally unbelievable, and all his enemies complete idiots","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T11:42:33-07:00","id":1409181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-official-sabbat-speculation-thread?p=1409131#post1409131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The one way to salvage the Sabbat from the V5 metaplot is to have the Gehenna war a scam; The elders of the Sabbat have betrayed their neonates as part of the all-round neonate progrom lead by elders of all sects who have realised they really need to cut down on kindred numbers to survive the next 50 years. Most of the Sabbat neonates sent over to fight in the middle east were killed in their shipping containers. But the ones who survived.... They'll be back with a vengence.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given the Lasombra were mostly pulling the strings, yet now wish to join the Camarilla, this doesn't seem plausible since your idea would be a very ruthless and pragmatic Lasombra style plot which, should it succeed, would allow them to mold more seasoned Sabbat into a more secretive sect. The older Sabbat tend to be much less Masquerade crushing and combat hungry, especially really old ones that remember the original Anarch Revolt. If the Lasombra are flipping camps, it's because they've lost control of the sect and it's members are running wild doing whatever they want, which would just lead the SI right to their doorsteps. Which is in fact what has been happening.<br /> <br /> Plus Sabbat do use phones and are likely chatting with each other across the sea regularly. Would be pretty much impossible for this conspiracy to work. Not unless they gathered thousands of Sabbat into a concert hall or something and then burn it to the ground with those vampires still inside.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2462-karlb","name":"KarlB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T11:53:03-07:00","id":1409184,"title":"","content":"Sorry, how does a the sabbat becoming a more secretive sect effect this plan? Perhaps some Lasombra are heading to the Cam to avoid the Gehenna war, perhaps some are staying with the Sabbat because they don't see the Gehenna war as a suicide mission, or they're aware that something's going on and they're in on taking advantage of the chaos. <br /> <br /> With the phones, there's a lot of ways you could get around that. You could have some sabbat actually make it to the middle east, where they fight staged methuselahs; They don't need or want to cull everyone, just a lot of folk. If anything, they can blame the large numbers of -failure to arrive- vampires as Gehenna war casualties and remark that the ancients were steps ahead of some (or that, y'know, the folk who defected to the Cam are Ancient stooges who set many Sabbat up to die) <br /> <br /> This conspiracy? It's well oiled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T12:17:32-07:00","id":1409187,"title":"","content":"wasn't the Gehenna war started by Francisco de Polonia?<br /> that guy was sabbat through and through","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T12:42:54-07:00","id":1409193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Origin